ecifies the technique used for data analysis, which can be Link Analysis, Statistical Analysis, or Pattern Recognition.\",\"min_value\":null,\"max_value\":null,\"enumeration_values\":[\"Link Analysis\",\"Statistical Analysis\",\"Pattern Recognition\"]},{\"type\":\"float\",\"name\":\"Confidence Score\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Confidence Score: float between 0.0 and 1.0' represents the confidence level in the analysis results.\",\"min_value\":0.0,\"max_value\":1.0,\"enumeration_values\":null}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Analyze Data: Analysis Technique, Confidence Score' links the 'Analyze Data' activity with the attributes 'Analysis Technique' and 'Confidence Score'.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Identify Threats\",\"description\":\"The 'Identify Threats' activity involves identifying potential threats based on the analyzed intelligence data.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"integer\",\"name\":\"Threat Level\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Threat Level: integer between 1 and 10' represents the assessed level of identified threats.\",\"min_value\":1,\"max_value\":10,\"enumeration_values\":null},{\"type\":\"float\",\"name\":\"Risk Factor\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Risk Factor: float between 0.0 and 100.0' represents the quantified risk associated with identified threats.\",\"min_value\":0.0,\"max_value\":100.0,\"enumeration_values\":null}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Identify Threats: Threat Level, Risk Factor' links the 'Identify Threats' activity with the attributes 'Threat Level' and 'Risk Factor'.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Implement Countermeasures\",\"description\":\"The 'Implement Countermeasures' activity involves executing the developed strategies to counter identified threats.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"float\",\"name\":\"Cost of Countermeasures\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Cost of Countermeasures: float between 100.0 and 1000000.0' represents the financial cost of implementing countermeasures.\",\"min_value\":100.0,\"max_value\":1000000.0,\"enumeration_values\":null},{\"type\":\"integer\",\"name\":\"Days to Respond\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Days to Respond: integer between 1 and 365' represents the number of days taken to implement countermeasures.\",\"min_value\":1,\"max_value\":365,\"enumeration_values\":null}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Implement Countermeasures: Cost of Countermeasures, Days to Respond' links the 'Implement Countermeasures' activity with the attributes 'Cost of Countermeasures' and 'Days to Respond'.\"},{\"activity\":{\"name\":\"Report Findings\",\"description\":\"The 'Report Findings' activity involves compiling and reporting the results of intelligence operations and monitoring activities.\"},\"attributes\":[{\"type\":\"enumeration\",\"name\":\"Report Status\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Report Status' specifies the current status of the report, which can be Draft, Review, Final, or Disseminated.\",\"min_value\":null,\"max_value\":null,\"enumeration_values\":[\"Draft\",\"Review\",\"Final\",\"Disseminated\"]},{\"type\":\"enumeration\",\"name\":\"Geographic Region\",\"description\":\"The attribute 'Geographic Region' specifies the geographic region associated with the report, which can be North America, Europe, Asia, Africa, or South America.\",\"min_value\":null,\"max_value\":null,\"enumeration_values\":[\"North America\",\"Europe\",\"Asia\",\"Africa\",\"South America\"]}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Report Findings: Report Status, Geographic Region' links the 'Report Findings' activity with the attributes 'Report Status' and 'Geographic Region'.\"}],\"constraints\":[{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Gather Intelligence' activity must be the first activity to occur in the process.\",\"template\":\"Init\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Gather Intelligence\",\"description\":\"The 'Gather Intelligence' activity represents the collection of intelligence information from various sources.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Disseminate Information' activity must be the last activity to occur in the process.\",\"template\":\"End\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Disseminate Information\",\"description\":\"The 'Disseminate Information' activity represents the final distribution of intelligence findings and reports to relevant stakeholders.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If 'Gather Intelligence' activity occurs, then 'Analyze Data' activity must also occur in the same process instance, and vice-versa.\",\"template\":\"Co-Existence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Gather Intelligence\",\"description\":\"The 'Gather Intelligence' activity represents the collection of intelligence information from various sources.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Analyze Data\",\"description\":\"The 'Analyze Data' activity involves processing and analyzing gathered intelligence data using various analytical techniques.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Gather Intelligence' activity occurs, then an 'Analyze Data' activity must eventually occur after the 'Gather Intelligence' event at some point in the same process instance. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Gather Intelligence' events can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Analyze Data' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Gather Intelligence' events. If 'Gather Intelligence' does not occur, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Analyze Data'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Gather Intelligence\",\"description\":\"The 'Gather Intelligence' activity represents the collection of intelligence information from various sources.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Analyze Data\",\"description\":\"The 'Analyze Data' activity involves processing and analyzing gathered intelligence data using various analytical techniques.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"An 'Analyze Data' activity must be followed by an 'Identify Threats' activity at some point later in the same process instance. Conversely, an 'Identify Threats' event can occur only if an 'Analyze Data' event has occurred before it within the same process instance. This bidirectional and ordered dependency ensures that 'Analyze Data' imposes obligations for future 'Identify Threats', and 'Identify Threats' cannot occur without prior 'Analyze Data'. Multiple 'Analyze Data' and 'Identify Threats' are allowed, with each 'Analyze Data' eventually leading to an 'Identify Threats' and each 'Identify Threats' being justified by a preceding 'Analyze Data'.\",\"template\":\"Succession\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Analyze Data\",\"description\":\"The 'Analyze Data' activity involves processing and analyzing gathered intelligence data using various analytical techniques.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Identify Threats\",\"description\":\"The 'Identify Threats' activity involves identifying potential threats based on the analyzed intelligence data.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Develop Strategies' activity is permitted to occur only if an 'Identify Threats' activity has occurred before it within the same process instance. 'Develop Strategies' that occur without any prior 'Identify Threats' are violations of the constraint. Multiple 'Identify Threats' can occur, and any number of events can happen between an 'Identify Threats' and a subsequent 'Develop Strategies'.\",\"template\":\"Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Develop Strategies\",\"description\":\"The 'Develop Strategies' activity represents the formulation of countermeasure strategies in response to identified threats.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Identify Threats\",\"description\":\"The 'Identify Threats' activity involves identifying potential threats based on the analyzed intelligence data.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Implement Countermeasures' activity can occur only if it is immediately preceded by a 'Develop Strategies' activity, with no other activities occurring in between. There can be multiple 'Implement Countermeasures'-'Develop Strategies' pairs within the process, each adhering to this immediate precedence rule.\",\"template\":\"Chain Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Implement Countermeasures\",\"description\":\"The 'Implement Countermeasures' activity involves executing the developed strategies to counter identified threats.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Develop Strategies\",\"description\":\"The 'Develop Strategies' activity represents the formulation of countermeasure strategies in response to identified threats.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"Whenever an 'Implement Countermeasures' activity occurs, it must be immediately followed by a 'Monitor Activity' activity in the next event position, with no other events in between. The 'Monitor Activity' activity is allowed to happen isolated elsewhere in the process but not between an 'Implement Countermeasures' and its corresponding 'Monitor Activity'.\",\"template\":\"Chain Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Implement Countermeasures\",\"description\":\"The 'Implement Countermeasures' activity involves executing the developed strategies to counter identified threats.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Monitor Activity\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Activity' activity represents the ongoing surveillance and monitoring of activities after countermeasures are implemented.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Monitor Activity' activity occurs, then a 'Report Findings' activity must occur after that 'Monitor Activity' event and before any subsequent 'Monitor Activity' occurs. No other occurrence of 'Monitor Activity' is allowed between a 'Monitor Activity' and its corresponding 'Report Findings'. This ensures that each 'Monitor Activity' is individually responded to by a 'Report Findings' in sequence.\",\"template\":\"Alternate Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Monitor Activity\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Activity' activity represents the ongoing surveillance and monitoring of activities after countermeasures are implemented.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Report Findings\",\"description\":\"The 'Report Findings' activity involves compiling and reporting the results of intelligence operations and monitoring activities.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"A 'Disseminate Information' activity can occur only if it was immediately preceded by a 'Review Intelligence' activity, and no other 'Review Intelligence' event is allowed between that 'Review Intelligence' and the 'Disseminate Information'. This ensures a one-to-one and ordered pairing between 'Review Intelligence' and 'Disseminate Information' events, preventing any 'Disseminate Information' from occurring without the necessary prior 'Review Intelligence' and avoiding overlapping or multiple 'Review Intelligence' before a 'Disseminate Information'.\",\"template\":\"Alternate Precedence\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Disseminate Information\",\"description\":\"The 'Disseminate Information' activity represents the final distribution of intelligence findings and reports to relevant stakeholders.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Review Intelligence\",\"description\":\"The 'Review Intelligence' activity represents the review of gathered intelligence and findings before dissemination.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null}]}"